<item><title>Congo steps up price checks and eases diesel access for essential-goods suppliers</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-steps-up-price-checks-and-eases-diesel-access-for-6dfb0a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-steps-up-price-checks-and-eases-diesel-access-for-6dfb0a/</guid><category>Republic of Congo</category><description>Inspections from 25 October to 14 November found breaches of approved prices as the government works to restore a reference price for butane gas.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:03:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-steps-up-price-checks-and-eases-diesel-access-for-6dfb0a/share.jpg" length="44850" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-steps-up-price-checks-and-eases-diesel-access-for-6dfb0a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Congo approves bills for 2063 vision and five-year development plan</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-approves-bills-for-2063-vision-and-five-year-08402d/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-approves-bills-for-2063-vision-and-five-year-08402d/</guid><category>Republic of Congo</category><description>The proposals set out six development pillars and public investment plans, and now go to Parliament for examination and adoption.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:29:42 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" length="37606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Congo ministers consider law to set development vision through 2063</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-ministers-consider-law-to-set-development-vision-40929a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-ministers-consider-law-to-set-development-vision-40929a/</guid><category>Republic of Congo</category><description>The proposed framework would put long-term national development priorities into law and guide successive plans, the economy minister said.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:14:21 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" length="37606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Congo launches two projects for livestock health and seed production</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-launches-two-projects-for-livestock-health-and-seed-e401a9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/cg/congo-launches-two-projects-for-livestock-health-and-seed-e401a9/</guid><category>Republic of Congo</category><description>The animal-health programme funds equipment for Brazzaville’s laboratory and nine control points, while a second project targets maize and forage seeds.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 08:15:38 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" length="37606" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/cg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
